# The pad's Back is the keyboard's Escape: each Back press below is followed by the same press of the keyboard's
# Escape, and the probes after them must agree. Start is Enter in the menus and Escape in play, where it opens them.
# Start a map, e.g. 'DM-Deck16][?Game=Botpack.DeathMatchPlus'.
waitlog up for play
sleep 3
pad attach
sleep 1
probe play
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 1
probe pad-back-1
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 1
probe pad-back-2
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 1
probe pad-back-3
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 1
probe pad-back-4
key Escape 1
key Escape 0
sleep 1
probe key-escape-1
key Escape 1
key Escape 0
sleep 1
probe key-escape-2
key Escape 1
key Escape 0
sleep 1
probe key-escape-3
key Escape 1
key Escape 0
sleep 1
probe key-escape-4
pad button start 1
pad button start 0
sleep 0.5
probe pad-start
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 1
probe closed
pad button start 1
pad button start 0
sleep 1
probe start-in-play
